        "audienceVibe": "Reflective, expectant, and ready for a story that rewards quiet courage and disciplined patience.",
        "bridgeIn": "Picture a steep hillside above Seneca Lake in late February, where the wind comes off the water like a wet blade and every neighboring vineyard has already finished its winter work.",
        "bridgeOut": "When the frost finally arrives\u2014and in every career, it eventually does\u2014the people who survive are rarely the ones who looked neatest in February. They are the ones who had the courage to leave room for the second chance.",
