        "bridgeIn": "Think about the last time a sleek plan looked flawless on paper, only to fall apart the moment it met a rainy Tuesday morning. That gap between the blueprint and the street is exactly where Nadia Okafor found herself one November in Columbus, Ohio.",
        "bridgeOut": "Real mastery rarely happens where the lighting is best. It happens when someone is willing to wake up at four in the morning, climb into the cold, and ask the people carrying the weight what the blueprint missed.",
